hence T is not a (Z′n , 1)-weighted zero-sum sequence. By Theorem 3.10 we have
EZ′n ,1 = n + 1. So we see that T is an E-extremal sequence for (Z′n , 1). Thus,
by Observation 1.6 we see that S is an E-extremal sequence for (Z′n , 1).
